Base URL: generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai
Default model: gemini-2.5-flash-lite, free tier via GEMINI_API_KEY.
Order: unorouter, groq, sambanova, mistral, gemini, cline, cloudflare.
Cloudflare is last in the walk; the local on-host slot comes first.
The extras order is the facts.md EXTRA_PROVIDER_ORDER; the primary
and local slots come from msrouter config, not facts.md.
Pause switch (moves together): msrouter replicas 0 and finder
FINDER_SCORING_ENABLED=false -&gt; CvScorer fallback score 70; the
score &gt;= 60 CV filter stops rejecting and APPLY_MODE stays shadow." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffcc;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="645" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Nh8AEH8Qvy1N4k/Yi8ND" value="POST /v1/chat/completions" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;endArrow=open;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" source="YeijSGQ4KoaRqxXrhT6X" target="rBpsXzAZQo1JXaRxMfvb" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="685" y="68"/><mxPoint x="725" y="68"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="VNeWJ2Q86g1YtztkNSWQ" value="local slot" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;endArrow=open;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" source="rBpsXzAZQo1JXaRxMfvb" target="+sk92EaXpNjbUT3BTvzU" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1047" y="96"/><mxPoint x="362" y="490"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pGZrfFaUhLYh4c0PFwbG" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;endArrow=open;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" source="rBpsXzAZQo1JXaRxMfvb" target="R8ZL5KS8fz1uS5xK+INX" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1370" y="68"/><mxPoint x="1410" y="68"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="/RAVvQaEV5D7B2nyzY9w" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;endArrow=open;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" source="rBpsXzAZQo1JXaRxMfvb" target="CG7TzQGiyOrDYFemZZRO" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1047" y="96"/><mxPoint x="362" y="190"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="vtgPqm6j1i/OYg3wSIlG" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;endArrow=open;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" s